# Task 3 — Basic John Usage

## Basic Syntax

```bash
john [options] [file]
```

## Check John

```bash
john
```

This can display John information, version details, and usage information.

## Wordlist Mode

```bash
john --wordlist=/usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt hash.txt
```

### Breakdown

```text
john
    → Start John

--wordlist=
    → Use a wordlist

/usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt
    → Wordlist

hash.txt
    → Target hash file
```

## Show Cracked Passwords

```bash
john --show hash.txt
```

`--show` does **not crack** the hash. It displays passwords that John has already recovered.

