# John Conversion Tools — Quick Revision

| Target              | Conversion Tool |
| ------------------- | --------------- |
| Linux `/etc/shadow` | `unshadow`      |
| ZIP                 | `zip2john`      |
| RAR                 | `rar2john`      |
| SSH private key     | `ssh2john`      |

The general workflow is:

```text
Original Data
     ↓
John Conversion Tool
     ↓
John-readable Hash
     ↓
John + Wordlist / Rule
     ↓
Password Candidate
     ↓
Match
```

